sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as React UI
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant LLM as OpenAI
    participant SOP as SOP Controller
    participant Tools as Phase-gated Tools
    participant Ver as Grounding Verifier

    User->>UI: message
    UI->>API: POST /api/chat (X-OpenAI-Key optional)
    API->>LLM: Understand (strict JSON schema)
    LLM-->>API: TurnUnderstanding (PII, hints, emotion, off_topic, injection…)
    API->>SOP: merge memory + evaluate gates
    SOP->>Tools: call only tools allowed in this phase
    Note over Tools: claim tools raise ToolGateError<br/>unless verified (+ consent)
    Tools-->>SOP: results → FactSheet (fact IDs)
    SOP-->>API: Decision (actions + FactSheet)
    API->>LLM: Respond (current-phase rules + FACTS only)
    LLM-->>API: {rule_check, reply, claims[{text, fact_ids}]}
    API->>Ver: verify reply against FactSheet
    alt grounded
        Ver-->>API: ok
    else violations
        API->>LLM: regenerate once with violations listed
        LLM-->>API: revised reply
        API->>Ver: verify again
        Ver-->>API: ok, or → deterministic template (grounded by construction)
    end
    API-->>UI: reply + citations + phase + memory + trace events
    UI-->>User: message (debug panel updates)
